     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">On Tuesday, June 21, 2016 at 6:30:30 PM UTC-4, Alireza RG wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">Here&#39;s the model I&#39;m trying to create:</font><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\t<div title=\"Page 1\">\r\n\t\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">z<span style=\"vertical-align:-1pt\">t </span>∼NB(μ<span style=\"vertical-align:-1pt\">t</span>, k),   μ<span style=\"vertical-align:-1pt\">t </span>=Xb + φμ<span style=\"vertical-align:-1pt\">t</span><span style=\"vertical-align:-1pt\">−</span><span style=\"vertical-align:-1pt\">1 </span>+αz<span style=\"vertical-align:-1pt\">t</span><span style=\"vertical-align:-1pt\">−</span><span style=\"vertical-align:-1pt\">1 </span>+(1−φ−α)μ </font></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">where X is my design matrix, b is fixed effect, k is shape, α, φ, μ are positive, and  α + φ &lt; 1.</font></div><div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\"></font></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>You need to constrain the parameters such that alpha + phi &lt; 1. So, this<br> </div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">parameters { </font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">  real b;</font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">  real&lt;lower=0&gt; shape;</font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">  real&lt;lower=0&gt; mu;    </font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">  real&lt;lower=0&gt; alpha;</font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">  real&lt;lower=0&gt; tmp;</font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\" size=\"2\">} </font></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
