should really be excluding Y[1]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  alpha </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// don&#39;t use a gamma(0.01, 0.01) prior for shape</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br>Ben<br><br></div></div>"
